d-universe</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\">\\(G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\)</span> 为显式有序目标，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"20aaef29b45de654\" href=\"?note=20aaef29b45de654\" title=\"57-df-goal-clause\">57-df-goal-clause</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"43bf0ac6633013d5\" href=\"?note=43bf0ac6633013d5\" title=\"57-df-sld-resolution\">57-df-sld-resolution</a>；原无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CAS}\">\\(\\mathrm{CAS}\\)</span> 在当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,G\">\\(P,G\\)</span> 环境下是这个集合的缩写。所有程序和目标矩阵原子均为关系符号应用，不含内建等号；假定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}\">\\(\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}\\)</span> 和逻辑后承见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" href=\"?note=d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" title=\"57-df-logical-consequence\">57-df-logical-consequence</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\models\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{And}(\\langle A_1,\\ldots,A_k\\rangle))\\to\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\neq\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\models\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{And}(\\langle A_1,\\ldots,A_k\\rangle))\\to\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\neq\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可靠性由每步采用原子合一实例的 Horn 蕴含而得；反驳从空体反向复合导出答案。完备性使用基 Horn 后承的有限证明树及逐步提升；无限搜索策略本身未被断言一定终止。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-sld-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"43bf0ac6633013d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sld-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-definite-program","status":"resolved","id":"c234c1cfaaa63dac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-definite-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-goal-clause","status":"resolved","id":"20aaef29b45de654","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-goal-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9f84d5a885cb119f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-univer